DATA NOTE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Data exported by this application (OSM XML, GPX, GeoJSON) is intended for
import into JOSM for review prior to any contribution to OpenStreetMap.
Users must comply with the OpenStreetMap Contributor Terms before uploading
any data: https://www.openstreetmap.org/contribute
